abstract: "Exact code and data for the facets of the polytope of anti-diagonal X-rays of doubly stochastic matrices: a certified facet test for the potential inequalities, a provably complete enumeration of the rays of the underlying tropical fan with independent recomputations, the complete ray and facet lists for k <= 12, certificate streams with exact checkers for the computer-assisted theorems on step potentials, and the checks behind every computational statement of the paper."
